### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:43000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "UserName": "qwe",
    "Password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de buscar todos os registros
GET http://localhost:43000/getAllAnimais HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:43000/getAnimalByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de inserção
POST http://localhost:43000/insertAnimal HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Malhada",
    "datanasc": "2023-02-14"
}

### teste de atualização
PUT http://localhost:43000/updateAnimal/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Mimosa",
    "datanasc": "2021-03-11"
}

### teste de remoção (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:43000/deleteAnimal/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
